@startuml
!include ../common/style.puml

title HANBAY HOTEL - Housekeeping State Model
left to right direction
hide methods

class Room <<aggregate root>> {
  +UUID id
  +String roomNumber
  +RoomStatus status
}

enum RoomStatus {
  AVAILABLE
  OCCUPIED
  DIRTY
  CLEANING
  MAINTENANCE
  OUT_OF_SERVICE
}

Room --> RoomStatus

note bottom of Room
  Housekeeping uses Room state directly:
  DIRTY -> CLEANING -> AVAILABLE.
  There is no housekeeping task aggregate
  or assignment model in the current scope.
end note

@enduml
